WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.960
The result of materializing and dematerializings

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.730
her Symphogear is that it's invading

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.070
her body even more deeply.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.720
Does this fusion threaten her in any way?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.910
She'll probably be dead soon.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.640
She'll die?

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.090
That's impossible.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:23.850
Miku...

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:41.930
Whoever comes after me...

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.730
I can't let them have this.

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.440
Dr. Ver...

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.980
Wh-Why are you here?!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:01:00.080
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.000
Hibiki!

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:06.630
She touched a Noise while she was still human?

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.520
Intelligence has lost contact 
with the pursuit squad!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.920
We're also detecting a Noise-materialization pattern.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:53.770
It's probably...

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.920
Send Tsubasa and Chris-kun now.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:01.280
Secure the man with the Staff 
of Solomon, no matter what.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.830
I'm detecting a different high-output 
energy pattern than that of Noise.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.290
Analyzing now.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.670
It can't be...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.800
<b>Episode 7 
When You Stop Being You</b>

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.480
Gungnir?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.540
My fists... And my life...

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.360
Both are my Symphogear!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.880
<i>The power's filling me up inside.</i>

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.870
Wh-What?

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.370
This heat...

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:54.980
Is it from Tachibana-san?

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.380
What's going on?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.350
You always show up at the worst times,

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:03.260
and ruin whatever I'm doing!

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:17.560
<i>I don't want to be a hero.</i>

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:22.030
<i>Make your wishes come true. 
Three, two, one, zero!</i>

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:27.860
<i>To create a world where we 
don't need those things.</i>

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:34.030
<i>I'll burst it... To reach you...</i>

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.540
Hibiki...

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.040
Always! Always!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:39.900
<i>There are dreams within my heart.</i>

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.420
Always! Always! Always! Always! Always!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:44.490
<i>It isn't fate, it's my road!</i>

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:47.320
<i>I want to believe. (I want to protect.)</i>

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.050
<i>So believe strongly...</i>

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:51.060
<i>And go!</i>

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.970
<i>Resound, resound, my heart!</i>

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:00.440
<i>Overcome your tears, my heart!</i>

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>It's all right, everything is just fine.</i>

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.310
<i>It doesn't hurt anymore!</i>

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:06.810
<i>Even if I wilt here,</i>

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:10.540
<i>the warmth will remain.</i>

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.190
<i>It will become a seed and sprout,</i>

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:16.810
<i>and my songs will become a billion strengths,</i>

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:21.110
<i>blooming toward tomorrow!</i>

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.470
A shield?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.650
A saw, in fact.

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.600
Shirabe-chan! Kirika-chan!

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:40.200
My Shul Shagana is actually

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:43.880
far more versatile than its scary 
appearance would indicate.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.530
It's an effective defensive weapon, as well.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.530
Even so, the two of us at full strength

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.030
are just barely managing to hold her back.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.790
I'm sorry, Kiri-chan.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.120
I can't brace myself with these heels.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.540
It's fine!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.110
Heretical technology, based on 
the Sakurai Theory,

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:06.940
is not the exclusive domain of the 
Special Disaster Mobile Response Team.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.780
The doctor's summoning of Noise

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.650
allows us to easily track his position.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.060
But, Mom...

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.560
I'm aware.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:19.190
If we've detected it, so have they.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.460
Let's hurry.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:23.440
You heard that?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.550
Recover the doctor and get out immediately.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.360
That's the idea, but...

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:44.430
Dealing with her won't be that easy!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.680
Since you're working so hard, 
I have a present for you two.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.320
What did you just do?!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.690
LiNKER?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.320
We still had time before it needed renewing!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.680
That's why I'm using it now.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:17.370
The only way to deal with that monster

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.040
is to fight it with more power 
than you currently have...

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.640
And to make that happen,

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:27.000
the first thing to do is to increase your compatibility values.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.810
But that means the stress from the overdose...

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.500
Shut up!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.760
Why would we do that to help you?!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.260
You will...

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.500
No, you have to.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:43.600
You would never have come to save me

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.940
out of sense of duty or because 
you consider me a friend.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:50.290
Which means that the old bat's 
condition must have worsened,

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.950
so you came running to me!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:59.700
Nastassja is sick and, without my skills 
as a biochemist, won't survive.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:03.160
Now, why not use the power,

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.630
currently beyond your limits, to save me?

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.010
There's an instability in Hibiki-chan's condition.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.020
Is this

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.520
caused by Gungnir's invasion of her body?

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.760
Where are Tsubasa and Chris-kun?

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.450
They're both hurrying to the area.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.500
But it will take a little more time.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.770
<i>Tachibana, don't do anything stupid.</i>

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.610
You...

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.580
Let's do it, Kiri-chan.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.210
It's our job to bring the doctor

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.580
back to Mom.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.210
Our Climax Song?

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.470
Yes... Sing, girls.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.640
Clinical trials have proved that

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.500
if your compatibility values reach maximum,

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.940
the backfire's impact can be lessened!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.480
So, with that LiNKER I just injected you with,

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.650
you can sing as many Climax Songs as you want!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.860
I guess we have no choice!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:20.750
It'll be okay, right?

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.060
Of course.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:25.210
Tachibana-san can't lose here!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:29.120
But if we stay here, we'll get in Bikky's way.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.710
Let's get out of here now!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:46.320
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.550
No... Is that a Climax Song?

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:53.860
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.860
Then I've done this to them, too?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:08.000
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.700
No...

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.950
A Climax Song, using LiNKER,

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.580
will rip the life right out of the wielders!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.450
A double Climax Song, from the goddess Zababa!

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:18.050
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el zizzl.</i>

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:11.530
That's the perfect solution for this situation,

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.090
as long as I have this...

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.710
I'll be able to take this back, too.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.620
<i>The Shul Shagana's Climax Song</i>

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:27.110
<i>is an endless series of strikes from a spinning wheel.</i>

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.150
<i>Even if I can't slice her into pieces, 
as long as I can stop her from moving...</i>

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.380
<i>Then the Igalima's Climax Song</i>

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:36.570
<i>will cut the target's soul in half with a single strike.</i>

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.730
<i>No physical means of defense will protect you.</i>

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.670
<i>It is absolute death!</i>

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:52.390
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:10:52.710 --> 00:11:00.470
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:58.720
Our energy levels aren't rising enough 
to activate our Climax Songs?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.710
Pressure loss?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.730
<i>Set Harmonics!</i>

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.240
She's stealing the energy?

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.920
I won't let you two

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.600
use your Climax Songs!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:05.240
No, Hibiki's leaving me.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:06.960
Kohinata-san!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.770
What's wrong?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.350
Hina, don't go that way!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.580
She took all that raging, destructive energy

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.760
into her own body?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.200
By connecting with others,

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.490
she can control a Climax Song.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:35.250
Then, this is nothing to her?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:38.430
Mom!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.600
Don't worry.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.320
These signals...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.910
They've caught up with us.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.210
Can you hear me?

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:54.160
Bring the doctor and return immediately.

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:57.320
But if we attack now...

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.320
Two high-speed signals are 
approaching your location.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.330
Probably the Ame no Habakiri and Ichaival.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.590
And you're under strain from

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.570
the LiNKER overdose, as well.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.080
Obey our orders.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.230
Understood.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.530
I'm better than I'd expected...

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.750
Even though we sang our Climax Songs?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:36.450
Did she protect us?

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.750
Why would she protect us?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.260
Hibiki!

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.840
No! Hibiki!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.400
Don't! You'll get a lot worse than a burn!

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.140
But Hibiki...

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:13.290
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.760
<b>Cavalry Flash</b>

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.020
Hibiki! Hibiki!

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:47.030
I wasn't able to protect Tachibana?

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.700
You couldn't protect her?

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:51.450
What are you talking about?

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:54.580
Did you know this would happen to her?!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.000
Answer me!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.830
Hibiki... Hibiki!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.080
Hibiki!

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.370
The numbers are stable.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:20.370
For your age, you have amazing endurance.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.230
Or did you use every ounce 
of mental energy you had?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.730
I'm relieved.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:26.480
I'm really glad!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.260
<i>What was I trying to make</i>

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.240
<i>these gentle children do?</i>

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.740
<i>I should have realized sooner
 that playing terrorist</i>

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:43.750
<i>wouldn't do anything to save us
 from the coming disaster.</i>

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.780
Our immediate first-aid attempts were successful.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:19.040
Successful? Then Hibiki's okay?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.610
Yes.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.640
Okay, let's get to the point.

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:36.100
This is the Nephilim's...

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.350
Its awakened heart, which I spent 
so much effort in recovering.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.080
By giving it the requisite number of relics,

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.680
it was finally able to unleash its full power.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.040
This heart and what you acquired five years ago...

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.290
Have you forgotten?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:58.360
The Shenshoujin that you, Finé, stole from
 a Mt. Minakami excavation team.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:01.500
Yes, that's right...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.500
Maria's memories have not completely recovered.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:10.330
Regardless, for the immediate future, 
handling the relics is my job.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.820
We'll discuss this in private.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.010
My apologies.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.760
Moving on...

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.430
The Shenshoujin, which breaks Frontier's seal,

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.260
and the Nephilim heart that activates it

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.440
are in our grasp at last.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:29.840
And for some time, we've known 
Frontier's exact location.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.320
That's right.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:36.450
Our crazy party preparations are all set!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.450
All that's left is for humanity

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.200
to dance to our capriccio!

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.960
We'll move the plan into the final phase shortly.

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:54.210
But for now, I'm going to rest a little...

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:10.400
Right now, globalization is 
proceeding more rapidly than ever.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.230
Trans-border economic activity...

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:22.260
There's something I want you to know.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:30.940
Damn it all!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:36.260
The relic fragments buried in her chest 
are eating away at Hibiki-kun's body.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:38.150
If this proceeds,

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:41.180
she'll cease to be who she is.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.410
In other words, if Hibiki doesn't fight again,

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.730
it won't hurt her anymore?

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:51.830
For Hibiki-kun, you are the most important tie

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.690
she has to her everyday life.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:57.710
I believe that the peaceful time 
she shares with you

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.780
is the one thing that can stop 
Gungnir from taking her over.

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:03.280
I can save Hibiki?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:08.140
I want you to protect Hibiki-kun.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.810
<i>I have to protect her.</i>

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.260
Shopping's a lot of fun,

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:30.430
but when there's all this stuff 
to buy, it's just boring work!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.940
Nothing to be done for it.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.660
Until the side effects from the 
LiNKER overdose wear off,

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:37.320
we're in charge of the chores.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.980
I'll carry those for you!

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:46.870
You don't seem to be doing well.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.200
Thanks. But I'm fine.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.830
Okay, then we'll take a break!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:59.910
After all that's happened, I understand now...

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:04.720
How weak my resolve and dedication were.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.850
And what the result of that will be.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:15.520
That's why, Mom, I—

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.830
There is no need.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.840
There are many bad things,

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.770
but we're so free.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.520
Back at the orphanage, I never 
could've imagined it.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.870
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.830
We were locked up there

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.540
to serve as vessels for Finé's soul.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:48.240
And Maria took her soul, in our place.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.830
It's so scary to think about losing who you are,

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:55.560
but we ended up putting that burden on Maria.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.320
Shirabe!

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:06.000
Have you felt like that this whole time?

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.540
I'm fine. I rested here, so...

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:10.580
Shirabe!

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:24.090
I don't need you to play the role 
of the new Finé anymore.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.510
Mom, what are you talking about?

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:29.350
You are Maria Cadenzavna Eve.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.350
You are only gentle Maria,

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:35.350
without Finé's soul within you.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.580
Finé's soul

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:42.140
did not enter any of the vessels...

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.860
That's all.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.000
Huh?

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:08.940
What's going on?
